Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Wie bringe ich ein Open-Weight-Modell auf Kubernetes?" }

### Semantic search over the talk abstracts
POST {{Api}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "GPU scheduling in Kubernetes", "top": 3 }

